---
interface Props { kind: 'structure' | 'sequence' }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
---
{kind === 'structure' ? <figure><svg class="factory-diagram" viewBox="0 0 760 500" role="img" aria-labelledby="structure-title structure-desc"><title id="structure-title">Abstract Factory class relationships</title><desc id="structure-desc">ReportGenerator depends on ReportComponentFactory and product interfaces. HtmlReportFactory and TextReportFactory implement the factory. Each creates matching heading and table implementations.</desc><defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs><g class="edges" marker-end="url(#arrow)"><path d="M380 60 V100"/><path d="M175 230 V185 H310 V160" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><path d="M585 230 V185 H450 V160" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><path d="M175 290 V345"/><path d="M585 290 V345"/><path d="M175 405 V445 H310" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><path d="M585 405 V445 H450" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/></g><g class="nodes"><rect x="270" y="10" width="220" height="50"/><rect x="250" y="100" width="260" height="60"/><rect x="45" y="230" width="260" height="60"/><rect x="455" y="230" width="260" height="60"/><rect x="35" y="345" width="280" height="60"/><rect x="445" y="345" width="280" height="60"/><rect x="270" y="425" width="220" height="60"/></g><g class="labels"><text x="380" y="40">ReportGenerator</text><text x="380" y="123">«interface»</text><text x="380" y="145">ReportComponentFactory</text><text x="175" y="265">HtmlReportFactory</text><text x="585" y="265">TextReportFactory</text><text x="175" y="370">HtmlHeadingRenderer</text><text x="175" y="392">HtmlTableRenderer</text><text x="585" y="370">TextHeadingRenderer</text><text x="585" y="392">TextTableRenderer</text><text x="380" y="449">«product interfaces»</text><text x="380" y="473">HeadingRenderer · TableRenderer</text><text x="420" y="87" class="edge-label">uses</text><text x="175" y="326" class="edge-label">creates</text><text x="585" y="326" class="edge-label">creates</text><text x="380" y="210" class="edge-label">dashed: implements · solid: uses / creates</text></g></svg><figcaption>Condensed UML view. Each family’s two products implement the corresponding product interfaces; the client also uses those interfaces.</figcaption></figure> : <figure><svg class="factory-diagram" viewBox="0 0 760 420" role="img" aria-labelledby="sequence-title sequence-desc"><title id="sequence-title">Creating an HTML report</title><desc id="sequence-desc">Startup chooses HtmlReportFactory and constructs ReportGenerator. The generator asks the factory for a heading and table renderer, then renders the report with those products.</desc><defs><marker id="seq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs><g class="nodes"><rect x="10" y="10" width="160" height="45"/><rect x="230" y="10" width="190" height="45"/><rect x="530" y="10" width="220" height="45"/></g><g class="labels"><text x="90" y="38">Startup</text><text x="325" y="38">ReportGenerator</text><text x="640" y="38">HtmlReportFactory</text></g><g class="edges" stroke-dasharray="4 5"><path d="M90 55 V400"/><path d="M325 55 V400"/><path d="M640 55 V400"/></g><g class="edges" marker-end="url(#seq-arrow)"><path d="M90 110 H325"/><path d="M325 175 H640"/><path d="M640 230 H325" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><path d="M325 285 H640"/><path d="M640 340 H325" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/></g><g class="labels"><text x="205" y="94">new ReportGenerator(factory)</text><text x="480" y="159">createHeadingRenderer()</text><text x="480" y="214">HtmlHeadingRenderer</text><text x="480" y="269">createTableRenderer()</text><text x="480" y="324">HtmlTableRenderer</text><text x="325" y="395">Ready to generate reports</text></g></svg><figcaption>Startup selects the family. The client requests both products once during construction. Dashed arrows are returned products.</figcaption></figure>}
<style>.factory-diagram{width:100%;height:auto;color:var(--muted);background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px}.edges{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5}.nodes rect{fill:var(--soft);stroke:var(--line);rx:5}.labels{text-anchor:middle;fill:var(--ink);font:13px system-ui,sans-serif}.edge-label{fill:var(--muted);font-size:12px}@media(max-width:500px){.factory-diagram{min-width:560px}figure{overflow-x:auto}}</style>
